.TH "LAGO" "1" "Aug 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-analytics-overdue-balance - List overdue balance


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago analytics overdue-balance [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Overdue balance is the total amount associated with overdue invoices (invoices with pending or failed payments which are past their due dates).


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--currency\fP=""
